This product includes protocol logic and CRC tables derived from TelloPy
(https://github.com/hanyazou/TelloPy), Copyright 2018 Hanyazou, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes from TelloPy: the library was rewritten as a smaller package. The
packet and log-record decoding was reimplemented and extended (additional
flight-log records decoded, field names and units corrected from real flight
recordings), several defects found in TelloPy were fixed, the event and video
handling were redesigned, and features outside the library's scope were left
out. TelloPy's source code is not included.
